{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_01",
      "hash": "554d391f561df61b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "透過精靈球 Plus外出中的寶可夢\\n目前正被寄放在培育屋，\\n因此無法返回。\\n\\n請於領回寄放的寶可夢後，\\n再試一次。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_02",
      "hash": "554d3a1f561df7ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正在連線……\\n請勿關閉電源。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_03",
      "hash": "554d3b1f561df981",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "把寶可夢放進精靈球 Plus裡，\\n帶著一起外出吧！\\n\\n和寶可夢一起走路和一起玩，\\n就能讓牠們快速成長。\\n\\n平時陪著寶可夢多走多玩，\\n還能獲得很棒的獎勵。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_04",
      "hash": "554d3c1f561dfb34",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "精靈球 Plus裡\\n有一隻禮物寶可夢！\\n\\n把精靈球 Plus連接為控制器，\\n然後去看一下「神秘禮物」吧！\\n\\n在接收贈送的寶可夢之前，\\n是不能帶其他寶可夢外出的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_05",
      "hash": "554d3d1f561dfce7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_06",
      "hash": "554d3e1f561dfe9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正在進行準備……\\n請勿關閉電源。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_07",
      "hash": "554d3f1f561e004d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出吧！\\n\\n在離開遊戲後，\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]長按[VAR COLOR(0000)]精靈球 Plus的[VAR COLOR(0006)]操控搖桿按鈕[VAR COLOR(0000)]，\\n就能和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]玩。\\n\\n想從外面回來的時候，\\n請再次選擇「和寶可夢一起外出」。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_08",
      "hash": "554d301f561de6d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "請按精靈球 Plus的按鈕\\n以連接至遊戲。\\n\\n連接成功後，\\n請按操控搖桿按鈕。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_09",
      "hash": "554d311f561de883",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有一隻寶可夢正在外出。\\n要把牠叫回來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_10",
      "hash": "55503e1f56203471",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "請選擇想要\\n一起外出的寶可夢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_11",
      "hash": "55503d1f562032be",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "找到了其他玩家\\n正與寶可夢外出的紀錄。\\c\\n若是仍然選擇外出的話，\\n原有的紀錄將被刪除。確定要外出嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_12",
      "hash": "55503c1f5620310b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 11]"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_13",
      "hash": "55503b1f56202f58",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有一隻寶可夢正在外出。\\n要把牠叫回來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_14",
      "hash": "5550421f56203b3d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要取消外出嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_15",
      "hash": "5550411f5620398a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正在連線……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_16",
      "hash": "5550401f562037d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出了！\\n玩得超級開心！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_17",
      "hash": "55503f1f56203624",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出了！\\n玩得非常開心！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_18",
      "hash": "5550361f562026d9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出了！\\n玩得很開心！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_19",
      "hash": "5550351f56202526",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "和[VAR PKNICK(0000)]一起外出了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_20",
      "hash": "5553c41f56234dfa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]獲得了\\n外出獎勵！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_20_s",
      "hash": "736f69acb4ca67c4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]獲得了\\n外出獎勵！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_21",
      "hash": "5553c51f56234fad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "準備尚未完成。\\n要中止準備嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_22",
      "hash": "5553c21f56234a94",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已更新至今的\\n外出紀錄！"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_23",
      "hash": "5553c31f56234c47",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已連接到精靈球 Plus\\n以外的控制器。\\c\\n要取消外出嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_24",
      "hash": "5553c01f5623472e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "準備完成！"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_25",
      "hash": "5553c11f562348e1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "選擇的寶可夢正在\\n別的精靈球 Plus外出中。\\c\\n仍然選擇外出的話，\\n其他精靈球 Plus的紀錄\\r\\n將會失效。確定要外出嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_26",
      "hash": "5553be1f562343c8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n[VAR COLOR(0002)]一起走路[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_27",
      "hash": "5553bf1f5623457b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n[VAR COLOR(0002)]玩耍[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_28",
      "hash": "5553bc1f56234062",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n[VAR COLOR(0002)]玩得很開心[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_29",
      "hash": "5553bd1f56234215",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n[VAR COLOR(0002)]玩得非常開心[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_30",
      "hash": "55572a1f56263123",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n[VAR COLOR(0002)]呼喚[VAR TRNAME(0001)][VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_31",
      "hash": "5557291f56262f70",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n[VAR COLOR(0002)]回應呼喚[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_32",
      "hash": "55572c1f56263489",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n[VAR COLOR(0002)]努力玩Pokémon GO[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_33",
      "hash": "55572b1f562632d6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "已完成[VAR COLOR(0002)][VAR NUM9(0000,0000)][VAR COLOR(0000)]次\\n[VAR COLOR(0002)]幫助Pokémon GO[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "mb_ctr_win_34",
      "hash": "55572e1f562637ef",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "正在寫入紀錄……\\n請不要關閉電源。"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "mb_ctr_cap_01",
      "hash": "8040b256847fd729",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "退出"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "mb_ctr_cap_02",
      "hash": "8040af56847fd210",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "【本次外出紀錄】"
    },
